{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:faa623776d46a8ba","name":"The Spanners","source":{"id":"source:reference-faa623776d46a8ba","title":"The Spanners","revision":24551,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T19:32:44Z","sha256":"393e8d43e476fb77b74ef1cdf18fdd02ebb9c88a027ac6afeadd18acf0026c9f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24551","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Spanners&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-faa623776d46a8ba","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," on the run has few friends. But an affiliation of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"- The Spanners- secretly aids ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," that have escaped their owners. Providing whatever hospitality they can, The Spanners repair and hide runaway ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},". Those Spanners that trust their masters make their allegiance known. If the Spanner is unable to find a runaway a position with its current owner, it passes the runaway to a trustworthy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," dealer. The Spanners have infiltrated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," dealerships, gaining considerable ability to move runaways and to secure safe positions for them.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
